    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d318">

                <pb facs="0442" n="422" sameAs="frus:frus1950v07/pg422"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">330/7–1850: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Embassy in India </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">urgent</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">niact</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1950-07-18T20:00:00-04:00">July 18, 1950—8 p.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>88. Urtel 137 July 18. We urgently desire release messages 9:30 July 19
                    Washington time or not later than 10:30. Later release would conflict important
                    presidential statement. Inform Bajpai and cable urgently time of release.</p>
                <p>Re. para 4, Dept does not intend release Nehru message rec’d here July 17.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
